# Direct requirements of panel_pipeline/ (plan, detect, status, assemble) and of the
# AMW modules it imports from core/ (gee, tile_utils, postprocess).
# Versions are pinned to AMW's requirements-lock_2026-09-18.txt, the versions on Ruby's
# Mac, so a score on the cluster comes from the same code as a score on the laptop.
# The lock files next to this file are generated from it, one per platform:
#   uv pip compile requirements/panel.in -c requirements/constraints-amw-2026-09-18.txt \
#       --python-version 3.11 --python-platform x86_64-manylinux_2_28 -o requirements/panel-linux.txt
# Do not edit the lock files by hand.

